<title>SWITZERLAND: TABLE-Nestle H1 sales rise 17.5 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Nestle H1 sales rise 17.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>VEVEY, Switzerland 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				    (billion Sfr)</p>
<p> Group sales		    33.5		up 17.5 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - full name is Nestle SA. Sales rise was in line with analysts' forecasts. The company did not give an comparative absolute sales figure for the first half of 1996, originally reported at 28.4 billion Swiss francs. Internal volume growth was 2.7 percent, favourable foreign exchange rate contributed nearly 11 percent to the sales increase.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
